      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like such a burden to everyone. like my family is constantly exhausted just trying to deal with my mess and my moods. i feel like a black hole sucking the life out of them. honestly i think everyone would just be so much happier and lighter if i just wasn't around anymore.",
